  "duration": 171.6186875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.18,
      "text": "We are rapidly approaching a baseline where everyone has access to the exact same artificial intelligence."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.94,
      "end": 11.96,
      "text": "When the software is universal, the technology itself stops being a competitive advantage."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.54,
      "end": 16.16,
      "text": "True lasting value comes from the person directing the machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.9,
      "end": 19.62,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down where your value actually comes from."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.22,
      "end": 27.32,
      "text": "It relies on specific human inputs, your choices, your questions, your independent judgment, and your personal skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.86,
      "end": 32.52,
      "text": "No matter how sophisticated the software becomes, the guiding philosophy remains the same."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.1,
      "end": 35.0,
      "text": "You must always be smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.72,
      "end": 37.78,
      "text": "That brings us to this final section of the course."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.38,
      "end": 44.76,
      "text": "This is a dedicated space to build and refine the exact human capabilities that differentiate you from the machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.34,
      "end": 50.06,
      "text": "While the outputs generated by artificial intelligence are fleeting and easily replicated,"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.86,
      "end": 54.26,
      "text": "the cognitive skills you build here belong entirely to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.26,
      "end": 59.08,
      "text": "They become your permanent property, securing your long-term competitive edge."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.92,
      "end": 62.74,
      "text": "Think about the very first time you learned how to ride a bicycle."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.58,
      "end": 67.22,
      "text": "That first bike with its training wheels was just a temporary tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.84,
      "end": 72.04,
      "text": "You eventually outgrew it, left it in the garage, and moved on to something better."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.88,
      "end": 76.04,
      "text": "During those rides, you built a critical, invisible asset."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.82,
      "end": 81.46,
      "text": "This diagram shows how your core sense of balance remained constant across different bikes."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.24,
      "end": 88.1,
      "text": "That skill then seamlessly transferred to entirely different activities, like ice skating or playing basketball."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.18,
      "end": 92.06,
      "text": "Nobody could simply hand you that sense of balance to download."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.78,
      "end": 96.3,
      "text": "You had to earn it through your own active struggle and physical repetition."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.06,
      "end": 100.62,
      "text": "Professional and intellectual development work the exact same way."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.16,
      "end": 106.54,
      "text": "The specific artificial intelligence applications we use today will eventually be outgrown and discarded."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.54,
      "end": 112.62,
      "text": "But the cognitive agility you develop to use them transfers seamlessly to whatever technology comes next."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.48,
      "end": 115.24,
      "text": "That brings us to our specific curriculum."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.14,
      "end": 119.8,
      "text": "We are focusing entirely on abilities that you build once and keep forever."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.54,
      "end": 122.62,
      "text": "We will follow two parallel tracks of learning."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.3,
      "end": 126.58,
      "text": "First, the technical practices required to operate AI safely."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.32,
      "end": 133.34,
      "text": "Second, the durable human capabilities that retain their value even if artificial intelligence were to disappear completely."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.14,
      "end": 136.84,
      "text": "This roadmap outlines how we build these parallel skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.7,
      "end": 142.4,
      "text": "Step 1 focuses on using AI safely, improving ideas and protecting data."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.22,
      "end": 147.38,
      "text": "Step 2 highlights interpersonal abilities and creative thinking to find a sharper angle."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.16,
      "end": 153.16,
      "text": "Step 3 requires staying flexible, continuing to learn and turning interests into real-world action."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.88,
      "end": 157.64,
      "text": "When you sit down to work, keep this single question running in the back of your mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.26,
      "end": 159.92,
      "text": "What do I bring that it doesn't?"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.42,
      "end": 165.22,
      "text": "As we see highlighted here, the software you use today is merely a temporary lease."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.92,
      "end": 170.06,
      "text": "But the cognitive abilities you earn through your own effort belong entirely to you."
    }
  ],
